- [ ] Encina.AspNetCore
- [x] Encina.EntityFrameworkCore
- [x] Encina.Dapper.*
- [x] Encina.ADO.*
- [x] Encina.MongoDB
- [ ] Encina.Messaging
- [ ] Encina.Caching.*

## Additional Context

### Implementation Tasks

- [ ] Create `ITenantScopedQuery<T>` marker interface
- [ ] Create `ITenantScopedCommand<T>` marker interface
- [ ] Create `ITenantEntity` interface
- [ ] Create `TenantIsolationPipelineBehavior`
