builder.Services.AddMultiTenant<TenantInfo>()
    .WithHostStrategy()           // subdomain.app.com
    .WithRouteStrategy()          // app.com/tenant
    .WithHeaderStrategy("X-Tenant-Id")  // API calls
    .WithClaimStrategy("tenant_id")     // JWT tokens
    .WithEFCoreStore<ApplicationDbContext>()
    .WithPerTenantAuthentication();
```

#### Tenant Info Model
